  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop brown onion (see ingredients). Trim green beans and cut into thirds.\n• Zest lemon to get a pinch, then slice into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84a414264524ca9791bd2/step-fca44900.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion and veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, until onion is softened and veggie mince is browned, 4-5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84a414264524ca9791bd2/step-8c90a410.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add arborio rice and garlic & herb seasoning, stirring to coat.\n• Add the water, lemon zest and vegetable stock, then bring to the boil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84a414264524ca9791bd2/step-4bb66d20.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Transfer risotto mixture to a baking dish and cover tightly with foil. Bake for 20 minutes.\n• Stir through a splash of water and green beans. Bake until liquid is absorbed, beans are tender and rice is ‘al dente’, a further 5-8 minutes. TIP: 'Al dente' rice is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84a414264524ca9791bd2/step-366c3a30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• When the risotto is ready, stir through Parmesan cheese, basil pesto, baby spinach leaves, the butter and a squeeze of lemon juice.\n• Once the baby spinach is slightly wilted, season with pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84a414264524ca9791bd2/step-a4a48c40.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide plant-based mince and basil pesto risotto between bowls.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f84a414264524ca9791bd2/step-10d2b650.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
